  "summary": "Growing up around computers and technologies, I developed an interest in anything involving computers at a very young age. I built my first computer when I was 10 and kept going ever since then. In high school, I've used Raspberry Pis in school projects and took every programming class that was available to me. Studying computer engineering in college was just the next logical step for me and I've only grown in my passion and interest in programming.  \n\nCurrently in college at Purdue University, I've worked on maximizing my opportunities and further develop my skills and interests. I'm currently a member of several clubs and communities across campus and hold executive positions in several of them. My focus now is getting a good start on my career after college and have taken an opportunity to work at SAP Concur as a Full Stack Developer and plan on expanding my skills in the workforce.\n\nPlease feel free to contact me with anything you may have for me.\nEmail: wilso923@purdue.edu\nPhone #: (202) 322-7771",
